{"channelId":"UCZUJ8cz4fJ5T5XZOoIubElw","row":["Brooke Drassal Equine Bodywork",1340,"Drassal Equine Bodywork is where horse owners, trainers, and practitioners learn how to help their horses perform and feel better.\n\nHey there, I'm Brooke Drassal. I created this channel to provide you with easy-to-follow massage tips and exercises you can do every day with your horse. Plus, you'll get insights and takeaways from top pros in the industry about horse training, rehabilitation, complementary therapies, and so much more.\n\nSo if you're a horse enthusiast that loves to stay on the cutting edge of equine performance and ways to keep your four-legged partner in tip-top shape, subscribe to my channel now.\n\nAnd stay on the lookout for new videos with expert interviews, actionable how-to's, and my thoughts on everything from using FES to help kissing spine to my go-to liniments.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZUJ8cz4fJ5T5XZOoIubElw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZUJ8cz4fJ5T5XZOoIubElw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:20.422Z","channelId":"UCZUJ8cz4fJ5T5XZOoIubElw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"80ebf05ff91e93ac3e6a16e0a06a6cd78b0a981fa6a2a429838f69fdfa3b4bc5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"8e6df5a42774a8a184dfb6d507e7ae77aa273ebdf3bfbccacad1b434b4ae0cf6"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZUJ8cz4fJ5T5XZOoIubElw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:50:35.906Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/drassalequinebodywork","identityStatus":"cross_linked","value":1268,"raw":"1,268","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/drassalequinebodywork/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T04:27:03.502Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZUJ8cz4fJ5T5XZOoIubElw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1340,"raw":"1.34K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.co